      "uid": "zhcn:a82bf3e05f3ab8012ad92015",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这个，我果然还是不知道。\n不过，如果我的表现回应了你的期待，那就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fcb3f4018183791b1b4d1d92a92306ff17aa4a14dfff7a9565c2d40f6258b88",
