    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cbdc33a3cad719fd287ef1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……反正横竖都要强制参加的。\n哪个项目都没差啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "843002f512b86cc75506ba0724a03ee2f9827ea0f20e5cb723f7fdbae55b6806",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0291f6b925dad3a5c4bc14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（但、今晚是……――）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aa23db4dd7002e23e40c152f67cb479ca203149baac17c01e934a3811b26e0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de93a7008b5fbbc53dc990ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心刚刚结束了大目标『英里冠军锦标』。\n却连休息的闲暇都没有，依旧在做着\n克己自律的训练。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ace5ac21342d745dbd1875605cc742fdab51c5faae5b6d51cb481cb910d1c30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc817b75f184b35cc0d1b899",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
