      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da3085e31f1e8a973a1cb565",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（还想说给你个惊喜的……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b77d13b63d08b1196dfc9e43cecf927f50ad823c975ac8d21830082127b3a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:495b601a43a7908e9f2e4f88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――真的好想约她呀。虽然不是约会啦……\n为了犒劳一直努力至今的她，\n我偷偷准备了一场小小的派对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bcd064b6f62eb4936b5f84118974ebf41450b03bdc32f07181cd110679d07b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:747360cfa0ea29fc9c3ba8b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……收拾一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24e30486ca07b1a5cbedb4e85a82334128617392e65ab0d4900c5df79b128bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112109.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebcbb78231c556f4c455a75a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许，我从一开始就放弃了主动去约吧。\n――毕竟，她可是超级受欢迎的人啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc92da76778591f0dbfb18b0badb1109850281dc6eb6ec41a6d77b354fa0554a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112109.json",
      "json_path": [
